('APX-C-3198', '3198', 'Hyper-real Handheld Mobile Phone Video Set in an Open', 'A hyper-real handheld mobile phone video set in an open dusty field in rural Brazil. Dry sandy ground, scattered trees, distant low houses. Bright midday sunlight, warm tones, slight haze. Visual style is slightly compressed with natural shake and motion blur, like real phone footage.', 8, null, 'https://x.com/rahulnanda86/status/2044096252678402072', 'A hyper-real handheld mobile phone video set in an open dusty field in rural Brazil. Dry sandy ground, scattered trees, distant low houses. Bright midday sunlight, warm tones, slight haze. Visual style is slightly compressed with natural shake and motion blur, like real phone footage. Ambient sound includes wind, children laughing, and dust swirling.

