('APX-C-3158', '3158', 'High-octane Cinematic Video', 'A high-octane cinematic video. A colossal, barnacled humpback whale violently erupts from a turbulent, deep blue ocean in a massive, twisting breach, sending explosive shockwaves of frothing white water high into the air.', null, null, 'https://x.com/IqraSaifiii/status/2043463569354998093', 'A hyper-realistic, high-octane cinematic video. A colossal, barnacled humpback whale violently erupts from a turbulent, deep blue ocean in a massive, twisting breach, sending explosive shockwaves of frothing white water high into the air. Riding the apex of the whale''s back is a fiercely athletic ballerina in a shimmering, electric-blue tutu. Instead of remaining still, she harnesses the whale''s upward momentum to launch into a spectacular, gravity-defying grand jeté directly over the churning abyss.Suddenly, an unexpected twist: as the whale reaches its peak, the crashing water violently ignites with bioluminescence, and a massive swarm of glowing, neon-pink flying fish erupts from the foam, soaring like arrows all around the suspended dancer. The camera abandons a slow orbit for a kinetic, fast-paced whip-pan, tracking the dancer''s flight through the glowing sea-spray, dodging the flying fish, before plunging momentarily underwater just as the whale''s massive tail slams down with catastrophic force. The warm golden hour lighting is dramatically pierced by a sudden, jagged bolt of violet lightning across the horizon. Audio features a deafening, thunderous roar of crashing water, the sharp crack of lightning, the chaotic fluttering of wet wings, and a soaring, high-tempo orchestral crescendo that cuts abruptly to silence as the camera dips below the surface."', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', 'golden-hour', '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: music', 'seedance_2.0', '@IqraSaifiii', 'https://x.com/IqraSaifiii', null, null),
('APX-C-3165', '3165', 'Bullet-time Sequence', 'Cinematic bullet-time sequence. Scene: A businesswoman wearing a white button-down shirt, black trousers, and black heels slips on an icy New York City sidewalk. As her foot slides forward, time suddenly freezes mid-fall.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/j_smeaton99/status/2043359878643880342', '15-second cinematic bullet-time sequence. Scene: A businesswoman wearing a white button-down shirt, black trousers, and black heels slips on an icy New York City sidewalk. As her foot slides forward, time suddenly freezes mid-fall. Action: Her body is suspended mid-air in a dramatic falling pose while a cup of coffee explodes into a huge brown liquid splash behind her. Large cubes of ice scatter and float in the air around her. The coffee droplets, ice fragments, and small debris remain perfectly frozen in time. Visual detail: She wears a futuristic red digital glitch visor across her eyes. Wind slightly moves her hair and shirt fabric while everything else stays frozen. Camera: The camera performs a smooth 360-degree orbital bullet-time rotation around her suspended body, moving from front view to side to behind her. As the camera rotates, the frozen coffee splash and ice particles create a dynamic frozen sculpture around the subject. Environment: Photorealistic New York City skyline with tall skyscrapers in the background, overcast winter sky, icy pavement reflections, cold atmospheric lighting. Style: cinematic 8K, ultra-realistic physics, dramatic slow motion, shallow depth of field, hyper-detailed textures, high dynamic range, volumetric lighting, Hollywood action film look. Duration: 15 seconds, smooth cinematic motion, epic bullet-time effect similar to The Matrix.', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'photoreal', null, 'high-fps-slowmo', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: beverage, photoreal', 'seedance_2.0', '@j_smeaton99', 'https://x.com/j_smeaton99', null, null),
