('APX-S-3345-3', 'APX-C-3345', 3, null, null, null, null, 698, 414, 'By 8s, his face flushes and he begins fanning his mouth, reaching for water as the heat intensifies. At 10s, he slams a palm onto the table, grabs rice desperately, and at 12s laughter erupts from behind the camera, shaking it violently.', 'chef', null, 'rice', 'featured', null, 'playful'),
