('APX-S-3319-1', 'APX-C-3319', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 240, 'Environment: A colossal glacial canyon under pale blue twilight. Massive ice walls tower above a frozen river while snowstorms sweep through the valley. The environment glows faintly with reflected moonlight from crystalline ice formations.', null, null, null, null, 'canyon, tower, river', null),
('APX-S-3319-2', 'APX-C-3319', 2, null, null, null, null, 242, 331, 'A gigantic glacier tiger made of solid ice and glowing frost veins prowls across the frozen river. Opposing it is a towering frost serpent emerging from beneath the ice surface.', null, 'leaping', null, null, 'river', null),
('APX-S-3319-3', 'APX-C-3319', 3, null, null, null, null, 574, 355, 'Velocity Ramp choreography: the tiger’s claws strike the serpent mid-air as time slows, showing ice shards and snow particles suspended before snapping back to real-time as the impact explodes through the frozen canyon.', null, 'leaping', null, null, 'canyon, river', null),
('APX-S-3318-1', 'APX-C-3318', 1, null, null, null, 'The rabbits look directly into the viewer as if they are recording themselves. The camera is never visible at any time. The video feels like discovered footage recorded by the rabbits themselves. Characters: 4–5 cute fluffy forest rabbits, different sizes, expressive faces, soft fur, playful personalities Action Timeline Scene 1 Rabbits appear close to frame, looking directly at the viewer.', null, null, 'The rabbits look directly into the viewer as if they are recording themselves. The camera is never visible at any time.', null, null, null, null, 'forest', 'playful'),
('APX-S-3318-2', 'APX-C-3318', 2, null, null, null, 'Bunny 1 (curious): "Is this thing recording?!" Scene 2 Another rabbit gently pushes forward. Bunny 2 (excited): "Move! I''m the main character!" Scene 3 Another rabbit leans in. Bunny 3 (very excited): "Hello internet!!!" Scene 4 Another rabbit tries to squeeze into frame. Bunny 4: "Wait… I want to be famous too!" Scene 5 Rabbits gently push each other, trying to move to the front.', null, null, 'Bunny 1 (curious): "Is this thing recording?!" Scene 2 Another rabbit gently pushes forward. Bunny 2 (excited): "Move! I''m the main character!" Scene 3 Another rabbit leans.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3318-3', 'APX-C-3318', 3, null, null, null, 'They all look directly at the viewer. Cute, playful chaos. Bunny 2 (laughing): "Hey! Give me space!" Bunny 3: "No, me first!" All rabbits softly giggle and continue gently pushing. Scene 6 (Ending) One calm rabbit steps slightly forward. Bunny 5 (calm, smart bunny): "No… they''ll probably Follow to Oogie'' on X." All rabbits suddenly pause.', null, null, 'They all look directly at the viewer. Bunny 5 (calm, smart bunny): "No… they''ll probably Follow to Oogie'' on X." All rabbits suddenly pause.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, 'playful'),
('APX-S-3318-4', 'APX-C-3318', 4, null, null, null, 'They slowly turn and look directly at the viewer together. Short silence. Then all rabbits smile at the same time. Camera: POV camera, direct-to-camera talking, handheld feel, gentle natural movement, close-ups, cute framing, camera never visible, no camera falling, stable handheld Audio: Cute bunny voices, soft wind, forest ambience, light giggles, gentle movement sounds Mood: Cute, funny, wholesome, viral-style social media content Ultra detailed, cinematic lighting, 4K, smooth animation, soft fur, expressive animation, high quality rendering', null, null, 'They slowly turn and look directly at the viewer together.', null, null, null, null, 'forest', 'comedic'),
